&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You are located in NYC and willing to come into the office 3 days a week&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
