&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll operate at the highest level of craft and strategy, partnering with Product, Engineering, Research, and Commercial teams to turn complex health data into experiences that feel clear, trustworthy, and genuinely useful. This is a hybrid-remote role based out of our San Francisco offices, with an expectation to be on-site at least half-time.&lt;/p&gt;
