&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner deeply with product managers, UX researchers, and engineers to build and continuously elevate the Ōura&amp;nbsp; experience across every touchpoint — from first impression to daily habit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Move with fluency from early-stage concepts and interactive prototypes to flawless, production-ready designs that transform health data into insights organizations can actually act on&lt;/li&gt;
