&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Connect the dots across teams and external partners to deliver cohesive, multi-platform experiences that feel like one seamless product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Rally the company around a bold design vision through storytelling, clear communication, and work that speaks for itself&lt;/li&gt;
