&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;8+ years of UI/UX design experience, ideally within high-growth or enterprise-scale products where design has a real seat at the table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A portfolio that stops people in their tracks — showcasing exceptional UI/UX craft and sophisticated data visualization across web and mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep mastery of Figma and a sharp, versatile design toolkit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Prototyping skills that make ideas feel real and bring stakeholders along for the ride&lt;/li&gt;
