&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Significant experience building or shaping design systems that scale without losing soul&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A rare ability to take complex health or technical data and make it feel simple, intuitive, and meaningful to the people who need it most&lt;/li&gt;
