&lt;li class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW11878871 BCX2&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW11878871 BCX2&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Lead collaborative project teams by developing timelines, coordinating staff assignments, and ensuring deliverables are completed on time, within budget, and to a high standard.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
