&lt;li&gt;Experience with implementing and managing logging and monitoring solutions such as CloudWatch and CloudTrail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to track, analyze, and optimize AWS cloud costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and as part of a team in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
